=== meta
title   = "开发流程的工具词典"
profile = "geml-statechart/v1"
===

%% 开发流程的起步词典（spec §5.3）：流程声明的用途预先绑好常见的命令，只读工具
%% 在所有阶段放行；其余工具照常放行，要拒绝或绑到某个用途，在这里写一行。`Bash(…)` 的键匹配以它开头
%% 的命令，`*` 匹配任意一段文字，字面部分最长的键优先：`wrangler deploy*--env staging`
%% 赢过 `wrangler deploy`，所以不带 --env 的部署按 production 算。

=== table {#tools}
| tool                                     | for            | allow | deny | default | params |
|------------------------------------------|----------------|-------|------|---------|--------|
| Read                                     |                | *     |      |         |        |
| Grep                                     |                | *     |      |         |        |
| Glob                                     |                | *     |      |         |        |
| Edit                                     | edit           |       |      | yes     |        |
| Write                                    | edit           |       |      |         |        |
| NotebookEdit                             | edit           |       |      |         |        |
| apply_patch                              | edit           |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(npm test)                           | test           |       |      | yes     |        |
| Bash(pnpm test)                          | test           |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(yarn test)                          | test           |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(cargo test)                         | test           |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(pytest)                             | test           |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(go test)                            | test           |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(gh pr create)                       | pr             |       |      | yes     |        |
| Bash(wrangler deploy*--env staging)      | deploy-staging |       |      | yes     |        |
| Bash(wrangler deploy*--env=staging)      | deploy-staging |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(wrangler deploy*-e staging)         | deploy-staging |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(npx wrangler deploy*--env staging)  | deploy-staging |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(pnpm wrangler deploy*--env staging) | deploy-staging |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(bunx wrangler deploy*--env staging) | deploy-staging |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(wrangler deploy)                    | deploy-prod    |       |      | yes     |        |
| Bash(npx wrangler deploy)                | deploy-prod    |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(pnpm wrangler deploy)               | deploy-prod    |       |      |         |        |
| Bash(bunx wrangler deploy)               | deploy-prod    |       |      |         |        |
===
